{
  "id": 8867094888647,
  "title": "Fox Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Animal Quilt Set Patchwork Style",
  "handle": "fox-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-animal-quilt-set-patchwork-style",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the rustic charm of the countryside with this beautiful Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set. Designed to bring warmth and tradition to any bedroom, it features classic patterns and soft, natural fabrics for a cozy, timeless look. This quilt set makes a perfect, thoughtful gift for loved ones and offers optional personalization to make it truly unique.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Rustic farmhouse design with a charming patchwork pattern, ideal for adding a touch of country elegance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An excellent choice for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, or daughter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various bed dimensions.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size, adding extra pillowcases, or including a custom name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable microfiber and polycotton fabric, designed for comfort and longevity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and recommended to air dry without heat, making maintenance simple and convenient.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each set includes one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases for a complete look.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
